<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="3JN" style="id">3jn --- Māori NT converted from rtf (LAI); 20100830 zb</book>
  <para style="h">3 HOANI</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ko te Pukapuka</para>
  <para style="mt1">Tuatoru</para>
  <para style="mt2">a</para>
  <para style="mt1">HOANI</para>
  <para style="imt">Kupu Whakataki</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Te Pukapuka Tuatoru a Hoani</char> i tuhia e “Te Kaumātua” ki tētahi o ngā kaiārahi o te hāhi ki a Kaiu. E whakanui ana a Kaiu mō tāna āwhina i ētahi atu Karaiti­ana me te whakatūpato atu anō mō tētahi tangata, tōna ingoa ko Rioterepi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Rāpopoto o Ngā Take</para>
  <para style="io1">Tīmatanga 1-4</para>
  <para style="io1">Ka whakanuia a Kaiu 5-8</para>
  <para style="io1">Ka whakahētia a Rioterepi 9-10</para>
  <para style="io1">Ka kōrero paitia a Rimitiriu 11-12</para>
  <para style="io1">Whakamutunga 13-14</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="3JN 1" />
  <para style="s1">He Mihi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="3JN 1:1" />Nā te kaumātua –</para>
  <para style="p" vid="3JN 1:1">Ki a Kaiu, ki te hoa aroha, ki tāku e aroha atu nei i runga i te pono.<verse eid="3JN 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="3JN 1:2" />E te hoa aroha, nui atu i ngā mea katoa tāku īnoi kia kake koe ki te pai, kia ora. Kia pērā anō me tōu wairua kua kake ki te pai. <verse eid="3JN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="3JN 1:3" />Hari pū hoki ahau i ngā tēina i haere mai nei, i whaka­atu mai i te pono i roto i a koe, arā i tāu haere i runga i te pono. <verse eid="3JN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="3JN 1:4" />Kāhore ōku hari e nui atu ana i tēnei, arā kia rongo ahau e haere ana āku tama­riki i runga i te pono.<verse eid="3JN 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ka Whakanuia a Kaiu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="3JN 1:5" />E te hoa aroha, pono tonu tāu mahi e mea nā koe mō ngā tēina, mō ngā tāngata iwi kē anō hoki. <verse eid="3JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="3JN 1:6" />E whaka­atu nā i tōu aroha i te aro­aro o te hāhi. Nā, kia rite ki tā te Atua tāu kawe i a rātou, ā, ka pai tāu mahi. <verse eid="3JN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="3JN 1:7" />He whaka­aro hoki ki tōna ingoa i haere atu ai rātou, kīhai anō i riro i a rātou tētahi mea a ngā tauiwi. <verse eid="3JN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="3JN 1:8" />Koia i tika ai kia whaka­manu­hiri tātou i ngā tāngata pēnei kia ai hoki tātou hei hoa mahi mō te pono.<verse eid="3JN 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ko Rioterepi rāua ko Rimitiriu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="3JN 1:9" />I tuhi­tuhi atu ahau ki te hāhi; otirā, kāhore mātou e manako­hia mai e Rioterepi, ko tāna hoki e pai ai ko ia kia meinga hei tua­tahi mō rātou. <verse eid="3JN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="3JN 1:10" />Mō konei ki te haere atu ahau, ka whaka­mahara ahau i āna mahi e mea nei ia, ki te kino o āna kupu i a ia e komeme mai nei mō mātou; kāhore hoki tāna i mutu i konei, kāhore ia e manako ki ngā tēina, e rīria ana hoki e ia ngā tāngata e pai ana kia pērā, e peia ana i roto i te hāhi.<verse eid="3JN 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="3JN 1:11" />E te hoa aroha, kaua e aru­mia te kino, engari te pai. Ko te tangata e mahi pai ana, nō te Atua ia; tēnā, ko te kai­mahi i te kino, kāhore anō ia kia kite i te Atua.<verse eid="3JN 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="3JN 1:12" />E kōrero­tia paitia ana a Rimitiriu e te katoa, e te pono anō hoki. Āe rā, ko mātou anō ētahi hei kai­whaka­atu; e mōhio ana koutou he pono tā mātou whaka­atu.<verse eid="3JN 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Poroporoaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="3JN 1:13" />He maha ngā mea hei tuhi­tuhi­nga atu māku, otirā, e kore ahau e pai kia tuhi­tuhi atu ki a koe ki te mangu­mangu, ki te pene. <verse eid="3JN 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="3JN 1:14" />E mea ana hoki ahau tērā ahau e kite wawe i a koe, ā, e kōrero tāua, he māngai, he māngai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="3JN 1:14">Kia tau te rangi­mārie ki a koe!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="3JN 1:14">Tēnei ngā hoa aroha te oha atu nei ki a koe. Oha atu ki ngā hoa aroha me te whaka­hua anō i te ingoa o tērā, o tērā.<verse eid="3JN 1:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="3JN 1" />
</usx>